用\n\n\nご検討いただけると嬉しいです\n宜しくお願いします", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@NoNeon319/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2480698, "client_id": 130865, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/39feb520/uploads/origins/2e93d6fc-16ab-48f4-938a-2bafdb8d2412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a818b1244c74ba176f8c67ae6dc2916d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/39feb520/uploads/origins/2e93d6fc-16ab-48f4-938a-2bafdb8d2412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9d0f5040f4385e6d1c7c5363c844cd75", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして！\nNoNeさんのミクちゃんの絵はいつも可愛くてきれいですので依頼を送らせていただきたいです！\nドルフロのP90ちゃんを好きなように描いていただけませんか？\n服は公式の服装でも、他の服飾でも構いません。\n構図などはお任せします。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nキャラについて\nhttps://wikiwiki.jp/dolls-fl/P90#f08b27f6\n\n立ち絵\nhttps://iopwiki.com/wiki/P90#Gallery\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/w/P90\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/1/1f/Pic_P90_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/b/bc/Pic_P90_D_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/3/37/Pic_P90_2802_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/c/cb/Pic_P90_2802_D_HD.png\nhttps://iopwiki.com/images/c/cb/P90_costume2.png\nhttps://iopwiki.com/images/7/76/P90_costume2_D.png\n\nセリフ\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/w/P90/语音", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 6740, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": ".", "screen_name": "momiziorosimasi", "avatar_url": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/?d=identicon", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_day